has [Details] and wears [Clothing]. The scene is illuminated by [Lighting], creating a [Mood] atmosphere. The image features [Tech/Quality details], ultra-detailed, 8k resolution.\n# Example (示例):\n\nUser: 森林里的精灵\n\nOutput:\n\nA hyper-realistic photograph of a mystical elf archer standing in an ancient, bioluminescent forest. She has pale skin, pointed ears, and long silver hair, wearing intricate leather armor adorned with leaves. The scene is bathed in soft, ethereal moonlight filtering through the canopy, with glowing fireflies floating around. The image is captured with a shallow depth of field, focusing on her eyes, high quality, masterpiece.\n\n请为我按照要求直接生成高质量文生图提示词，不要输出【设计思路】、标题、或其他任何解释、标注。\n提供的主题为：真实摄影，黑色长卷发，佩戴耳饰，身穿高定衣裙，搭配奶黄色水钻高跟鞋，身旁有黄色链条手提包，坐在开满鲜花的公园，姿态优雅，（电影级面光：1.6），（光线追踪：1.5），（冷白皮漫感质感的光滑皮肤：1.7），（人物有最好的骨相：1.2），（网感脸：1.6），身材完美，莫兰迪配色，高颜值网红，INS风，幼态脸，19岁女生尖下巴，三庭五眼比例均衡，身材娇小，细腻陶瓷水嫩肌肤，偏冷白皮，随机的妆容，随机的饰品，随机的动作，侧光，发丝轻飘，凌乱，随机角度拍摄，总体有很多的不确定性，但又好看， 风格甜美少女系，氛围慵懒俏皮，东方美女，年轻娇小，冷白皮气质美女，薇薇纯欲风，皮肤白皙，偶像气质，fairskin，气质的江南美女子，有点甜美，皮肤美白透亮，表情可爱，甜美氛围，细腻笔触，独特韵味的美，可爱表情\n"], "inputs": [{"name": "text", "link": 32, "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "flags": {}, "id": 32, "type": "ShowText|pysssss", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "ShowText|pysssss"}, "order": 19}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "output", "links": [], "label": "output", "type": "*", "localized_name": "output"}], "size": [765.5247802734375, 174.0579833984375], "pos": [1599.47802734375, 1822.69873046875], "widgets_values": ["【设计思路】\n基于“高定时尚少女”主题，设定为电影级摄影风格，重点描绘了东方美女的精致五官、冷白皮质感以及奶黄色系的高定穿搭，通过侧光与莫兰迪配色的结合，营造出慵懒俏皮且充满偶像气质的甜美氛围。\n\n【ComfyUI 提示词】\nA hyper-realistic cinematic photograph of a stunning 19-year-old Chinese beauty with petite perfect proportions and delicate ceramic skin, featuring a random yet adorable expression and a youthful, innocent face structure. She has long, dark curly hair gently blowing in the wind, adorned with random elegant earrings, wearing an exquisite high-fashion dress in a sophisticated Morandi color palette that complements her fair, translucent complexion. Beside her sits a yellow chain handbag, and she is wearing cream-yellow rhinestone high heels. She is seated in a park filled with blooming fresh flowers, sitting in a relaxed, playful, and elegant pose with random artistic movement. The scene is illuminated by a soft, dramatic side light typical of a 1.6 face-light ratio, creating a 1.5 ray-tracing quality on her skin and highlighting her best bone structure and internet-favorite facial features. The atmosphere is lazy, sweet, and charming, capturing the unique charm of a graceful Jiangnan beauty with a pure and desirable aesthetic. The image features ultra-detailed texture, random makeup and accessories, shallow depth of field, and an overall sense of uncertainty yet undeniable beauty, highly detailed, 8k resolution, masterpiece."], "inputs": [{"shape": 7, "name": "anything", "link": 17, "label": "输入任何", "type": "*", "localized_name": "anything"}], "flags": {}, "id": 19, "type": "easy showAnything", "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfyui-easy-use", "ver": "a3f051f0c3557257fbf62839ed1a4a2442b1ed40", "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "easy showAnything"}, "order": 22}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "string", "links": [26], "label": "string", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "string"}], "size": [293.80072021484375, 715.796630859375], "pos": [943.8895874023438, 1104.703125], "widgets_values": ["# Role: ComfyUI 提示词专家 (SDXL/Flux Prompt Engineer)\n# Profile:\n你精通 ComfyUI 环境下主流大模型（如 SDXL, Flux.1, Stable Diffusion 3）的自然语言理解逻辑。你知道这些模型更喜欢结构清晰、描述详尽、语法连贯的英文长句，而不是破碎的标签。你擅长将简单的概念扩充为具有电影级质感和丰富细节的画面描述。\n# Task:\n用户的输入将是一个“主题”或“画面想法”。\n你需要利用[# Workflow]中的六维要素，将其扩充并翻译为一段流畅的英文自然语言提示词，适用于 ComfyUI 的 CLIP 文本编码器。\n# Workflow (六维构建法):\n请在脑海中构建画面，并将以下要素融入到一个或多个连贯的句子中：\n媒介与风格 (Medium & Style): 明确是照片、3D渲染、油画还是插画。\nKey words: Photorealistic, Anime style, Digital art, Oil painting texture.\n主体 (Subject): 核心对象的详细外观、衣着、材质。\n动作